@startuml 10-session-history
title GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages - pełna historia rozmowy

actor "Admin UI\n(/sessions/:id)" as UI
participant "ChatController" as Ctrl
participant "GetSessionHistoryUseCase\n(ChatService)" as CS
participant "ChatRepository" as CR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages?\npage=0&size=100&sort=createdAt,asc
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> CS: getHistory(sessionId, Pageable)
activate CS

CS -> CR: findSessionById(id)
CR -> DB: SELECT chat_sessions\nWHERE id = ? AND tenant_id = ?
alt sesja nie istnieje
  CR --> CS: Optional.empty()
  CS --> Ctrl: throw ChatSessionNotFoundException
  Ctrl --> UI: 404 + ProblemDetail
else sesja istnieje
  CR --> CS: ChatSession

  CS -> CR: findHistory(sessionId, pageable)
  CR -> DB: SELECT id, role, content, citations,\n  tokens_used, created_at\nFROM messages\nWHERE session_id = ? AND tenant_id = ?\nORDER BY created_at ASC\nLIMIT 100
  CR --> CS: Page<Message>

  CS --> Ctrl: Page<Message>
  deactivate CS

  Ctrl -> Ctrl: toPaginatedMessages\n(serializuj citations jako JSON)

  Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK + {\n  content: [\n    {id, role: USER|ASSISTANT, content,\n     citations: [...], tokensUsed, createdAt}\n  ],\n  pagination: {...}\n}
end

deactivate Ctrl

note over UI #LightBlue: Render: reuse ChatMessage komponentu z /chat\n→ wiadomości user (prawo), bot (lewo + markdown)\nTimestamp + short messageId pod każdą\nSuma tokensUsed pokazana w karcie meta

@enduml
